I arrive at the office.
There is a lot of light in the office.
There are many people here.
I go inside.
A man comes to me.
He smiles.
He says, "Hello!"
"Are you Maya?"
I say, "Yes, I am Maya."
He says, "Welcome to the office."
"My name is Rohan."
I say, "Hello Rohan, nice to meet you."
Here we do not say sir or madam.
We only use names.
Rohan asks, "Which team do you work in?"
I reply, "I work in the mobile app development team."
Rohan says, "Great!"
He adds, "I am in the software team."
Rohan is very friendly.
I like my first day.
